        "text": "Analyze this receipt, invoice, or payment proof image.\nExtract the transaction details and summarize it into a single natural sentence in Indonesian so the financial assistant can record it.\n\nFormat example:\n\"Catat pengeluaran beli [nama barang/merchant] sebesar [total nominal angka tanpa titik/koma] kategori [Food/Shopping/Transportation/dll] metode [QRIS/Cash/Debit/dll] tanggal [YYYY-MM-DD jika tertera]\"\n\nIf it is income/transfer in proof, format:\n\"Catat pemasukan dari [pengirim] sebesar [nominal] kategori Income metode Transfer tanggal [YYYY-MM-DD]\"\n\nIf the image is not a financial receipt/proof, simply respond with: \"Bukan bukti transaksi\".",
